+            "this IPC endpoint is IPv4-only (ThreadingHTTPServer / AF_INET), so this host "
+            "cannot be bound here; IPv6 (e.g. ::1) is not supported, use an IPv4 address "
+            "such as 127.0.0.1"
+        )
